WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:07.760
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain an episode called “ADHD is Necessary”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:15.920
from a Sci-fi drama anthology “On Children.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
 &nbsp;

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:24.080
In the future, the government wants only genius&nbsp;
citizens to live in their country. For this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:29.440
they implant an embryo in all women. The mothers&nbsp;
are given the responsibility to raise the children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:35.360
to become an A-grade student. If a child gets good&nbsp;
grades, he and his mother are given an apartment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:41.440
in an exclusive complex. Such mothers are also&nbsp;
awarded a glowing pin for their contribution to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:47.600
society. The ones who do not get good grades&nbsp;
have to live in slums called the pigeon cage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.560
At the beginning of the movie, a mother is being&nbsp;
implanted with a new embryo. After the process,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:58.000
she is handed a guidebook on how to raise the&nbsp;
embryo. She is asked to follow the guidelines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.520
properly. Yang Chuan is the top mother who&nbsp;
has raised the best student they have ever had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:09.440
named Ruo-Jie. Unfortunately, he was killed&nbsp;
in an accident some years ago. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:14.560
she was implanted with a second embryo and&nbsp;
gave birth to Nova. Currently, she is in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:19.840
a ceremony being awarded for her book on how a&nbsp;
mother can help their children get good grades.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:24.880
Chuan is considered the best mother by many.&nbsp;
A woman in the audience asks her the secret&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:30.720
to raising A-grade children. The question&nbsp;
takes Chuan by surprise so she remains quiet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.960
The presenter claims that the question is&nbsp;
personal so she wouldn’t have to answer it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.520
It is clear that Chuan is hiding something.
Somewhere else, the higher officials of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:44.720
state are discussing the surge in the number of&nbsp;
narcoleptic children. Such children are taken to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:50.640
the advancement programs and killed by the state,&nbsp;
declaring them as faulty embryos. Researcher Yi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:55.520
Xian notices that all the students suffering&nbsp;
from sleep disorders have scored less than the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.520 --> 00:02:00.400
minimum standard. He puts two and two together&nbsp;
and finds out that the students who score low&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:05.760
are being falsely diagnosed, so the state could&nbsp;
get rid of them. When he confronts his superiors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:11.040
about the matter, they falsely accuse him of&nbsp;
running an underground rebellious organization&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:16.560
against the state. He is soon arrested. Chuan is&nbsp;
with her daughter walking to their apartment after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:22.000
the program. Alongside them, the students with low&nbsp;
scores and their mothers are being taken somewhere&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:27.360
by the guards. Suddenly, a woman comes running to&nbsp;
them, yelling that the students will be killed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:32.640
They panic and refuse to go with the guards. As&nbsp;
the crowd gets bigger, they start to run away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:39.440
creating chaos. Amidst it, Chuan’s scarf falls to&nbsp;
the floor. After the commotion ends, Nova offers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:45.680
to wash the scarf on her way to the bathroom. The&nbsp;
researcher Yi xian’s mother, Ling-Na recognizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:51.040
Nova as Chuan’s daughter. She seems to know&nbsp;
something about Chuan but doesn’t reveal it to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:56.800
the girl. She simply hands her a keychain and says&nbsp;
that it is a gift from her late older brother.
 &nbsp;

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:01.760
A confused Nova returns to her mother and&nbsp;
finds her watching the news on a big screen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:08.080
It says that Yi Xian was going against the state&nbsp;
and its system so he was executed. His mother has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:13.360
also been removed from the list of top mothers&nbsp;
because of his deeds. Nova recognizes the woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:18.640
as the person who gave her the keyring. However,&nbsp;
she doesn’t tell her mother about the encounter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:24.800
At home, Nova’s tutor teaches her about the first&nbsp;
cloning process for her upcoming exams. Nova&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:29.920
is not as diligent as her older brother, which&nbsp;
worries Chuan. She wants her daughter to score A+&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.960
at any cost because if she doesn’t they&nbsp;
will have to give up all their privileges.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:39.200
Moreover, she is considered the best mother&nbsp;
in the city, so her daughter not getting good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:44.080
grades is humiliating for her. After the&nbsp;
class, the tutor frankly tells her that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:49.440
thinks Nova will not pass the next test since her&nbsp;
grades have been falling every year. One of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:54.480
lights in Chuan’s “top mother pin” goes out. She&nbsp;
thinks that it is because of a technical problem&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.480 --> 00:04:00.320
but the teacher explains that the lights go off&nbsp;
when one’s kid doesn’t perform well. Since Chuan’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:05.200
children had always had the best grades till&nbsp;
now, she didn’t know about the feature. The light&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:10.400
embarrasses her so she wears a scarf to hide it.
Following her meeting with the tutor, she brings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:15.200
Nova to the pigeon cage where all the people&nbsp;
with low grades live. She wants her daughter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:20.720
to get a taste of the life she will have if she&nbsp;
isn’t good at studies. In her heart, Chuan knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:25.760
that she doesn’t care about her child, she is&nbsp;
only worried about the humiliation she will face&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:31.440
if she has to leave the apartment complex. The&nbsp;
following day, Chuan has to go grocery shopping.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:36.640
Embarrassed by her pin, she tries to put it down&nbsp;
but it blares an alarm telling her that she should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:41.680
wear it everywhere she goes. She efficiently&nbsp;
hides it with a scarf and goes to the store&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:47.760
but a woman sees it nonetheless. She asks Chuan if&nbsp;
her daughter is getting good grades. Chuan openly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:53.440
lies and says that Nova is doing better than ever.&nbsp;
On returning home, she witnesses a woman getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:58.880
kicked out of the apartment complex because of her&nbsp;
son’s grade. She blames her son for not being good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:03.760
enough. The woman had been living in luxury for&nbsp;
the past fifteen years, and now she has to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:08.960
a life in the slums. Chuan holds her pin tightly,&nbsp;
seeing that she could go through the same thing in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:15.520
the future. Later, she monitors Nova giving a test&nbsp;
through her tablet. Nova is visibly struggling to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:21.840
answer questions which worries Chuan even more.
Soon, the second light in her pin also goes off.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:26.720
Now, she has only three lights to go before&nbsp;
she has to leave the apartment and give up her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:32.320
privileges. The next day at school, Nova acts&nbsp;
strange. She keeps on fidgeting with her pen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:37.360
and books. When the person behind her asks&nbsp;
her to not move so much, she lashes out at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:42.240
him. Even when the teacher asks her to not&nbsp;
be rude, she tells him his class is boring.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:47.920
Everyone is surprised at her behavior because she&nbsp;
is usually very gentle and nice. The next day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:53.120
Chuan brings her to the hospital to get her&nbsp;
checked. She is diagnosed with ADHD. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:57.840
doctor claims that the stress of exams might have&nbsp;
been the cause of the disorder. He warns Chuan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:02.480
to take good care of her daughter because if the&nbsp;
syndrome gets worse, she might go into depression.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:10.000
The next day at school, Nova accidentally hits&nbsp;
her teacher on the leg while sweeping the floor.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:15.120
She doesn’t apologize for her mistake and instead,&nbsp;
tells him he should watch where he is going. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:20.960
conversation escalates quickly and the teacher&nbsp;
holds her arm asking her to apologize. Nova runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:26.880
away and threatens to jump off the building. She&nbsp;
is stopped by her classmate Qi Zheng at last.
 &nbsp;

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:32.960
Chuan simply brings her home and serves her&nbsp;
dinner. It is then revealed that Chuan has asked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:39.360
Nova to pretend to have ADHD so they can use it as&nbsp;
an excuse to avoid the upcoming exams. Chuan says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:44.720
she is proud of her for her believable acting. The&nbsp;
next day is Nova’s birthday. Chuan wants her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:49.600
destroy all the presents that her classmates give&nbsp;
her. Nova is reluctant because she doesn’t want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:55.680
hurt her friends but Chuan persuades her to bring&nbsp;
a razor to school. At school, Nova’s friends wish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.680 --> 00:07:01.360
her a happy birthday. She knows what she has to do&nbsp;
but she cannot bring herself to hurt them. Chuan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:07.600
watches her on a laptop as she puts the razor away&nbsp;
and gently opens her presents. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:13.120
Qi Zheng and Nova talk about her weird behavior&nbsp;
yesterday. She claims that she was just nervous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:17.120
because of the test. Qi Zheng asks her&nbsp;
if she is being pressured by her mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:21.440
but she claims that her mother is very&nbsp;
helpful, and she would never pressurize her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:27.600
On reaching home, Nova apologizes to her mother.&nbsp;
She doesn’t want to pretend to have ADHD anymore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:32.800
and claims that she will study hard to get good&nbsp;
grades instead. Later at night, she shows her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:37.360
mother the keyring that the strange woman had&nbsp;
given her in the bathroom. Chuan is shocked to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:42.800
see it but doesn’t reveal its significance. She&nbsp;
simply asks her daughter to continue studying.
 &nbsp;

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:48.880
A flashback shows us that the keyring was handmade&nbsp;
by her late son Ruo-Jie as a birthday present for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:54.480
her. But she asked him to stop making such&nbsp;
absurd things and focus on his studies. Back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.480 --> 00:08:00.560
in the present, Nova starts to study harder than&nbsp;
ever and stops pretending to have ADHD. One day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:04.880
she is again approached by the same old&nbsp;
woman, Ling-Na. She has found out about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:11.040
Nova’s ADHD diagnosis and asks her if she really&nbsp;
has it or was it her mother’s plan. She reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:16.080
that according to the guidebook, the students&nbsp;
with ADHD are considered defective embryos.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:21.360
They are sent to an advancement program where they&nbsp;
are secretly killed. If a student gets bad grades,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:27.440
both he and his mother are sent to the slums.&nbsp;
However, if the students have defects like ADHD,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:32.080
they are sent to advancement programs and the&nbsp;
mothers can still enjoy their old privileges.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:39.600
Chuan has been urging Nova to pretend because she&nbsp;
wants to keep her privileges even if it is at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:45.520
cost of her daughter’s life. Nova is in disbelief.&nbsp;
Furthermore, she is informed that her brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:51.440
Ruo-Jie’s death wasn’t an accident. She argues&nbsp;
that he was the best student nationwide so that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:57.360
cannot be possible. Later that day, she reads the&nbsp;
article about Ruo-Jie’s death and finds out he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:02.800
hit by a truck. She then goes to meet the truck&nbsp;
driver who claims he was manipulated by her mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:08.320
to take the blame. Nova finally realizes that&nbsp;
her mother had to do something with his death.
 &nbsp;

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:14.160
The next day, she asks Qi Zheng if he knows about&nbsp;
the advancement program that kills people. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:19.600
asks her to be quiet because talking about it is&nbsp;
illegal. Qi Zheng lives in the slums, so he knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:24.800
everything about the state’s unfair program. Chuan&nbsp;
sees them talking through the surveillance cameras&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:30.480
and goes to meet Qi Zheng the next day. She asks&nbsp;
him to stay away from her daughter. But Qi Zheng’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:35.600
mother stands up for her son, claiming that he can&nbsp;
talk to whoever he wants. After finding out she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:41.280
will soon be sent to the advancement program, Nova&nbsp;
runs away from home and goes to Qi Zheng’s house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:45.360
His mother brings her to a secret tunnel&nbsp;
that leads them to a camp of survivors of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:51.280
the advancement program. It was established by&nbsp;
Ling-Na after her son’s execution. She believes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:55.920
that every kid has something they are good at&nbsp;
and grades don't define their worth. Hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.920 --> 00:10:01.360
she has established this place to give those kids&nbsp;
an opportunity to do whatever they enjoy. Everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:06.480
at the camp is nice to Nova but she feels like she&nbsp;
is betraying her mother by staying there. When no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:11.920
one is looking, she leaves them a message and runs&nbsp;
away. In the message, she expresses her gratitude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:17.920
to them and promises to not tell others about the&nbsp;
camp. When she reaches home, Chuan simply asks her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:23.760
to eat her dinner. Nova apologizes for letting&nbsp;
her down and promises to study even harder. 
 &nbsp;

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.920
She asks her mother if she loves her&nbsp;
but Chuan doesn’t answer her question.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:34.640
Later, Nova is in the shower when she feels dizzy.&nbsp;
She falls to the ground and drags herself out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:40.880
When she opens her eyes, she finds herself in a&nbsp;
hospital bed. She is declared a faulty embryo and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:46.720
sent to the advancement program to be executed. In&nbsp;
the following scene, we see Chuan being implanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:52.240
with another embryo. When she wakes up after the&nbsp;
transplant, she finds herself in the tunnel that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:58.320
leads to the survivor camp. Ling-Na asks her if&nbsp;
she is happy after killing two of her children.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:03.360
She claims that her third one will grow to be&nbsp;
the same. Chuan still doesn’t back down and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:09.120
asserts that she has won this war. She returns&nbsp;
home and gets to keep the apartment along with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:15.040
all her privileges. She even writes a book&nbsp;
about losing two children and profits off it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:20.880
A flashback shows us that Ruo-Jie wanted to be&nbsp;
a carpenter but Chuan didn’t support his dream.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:26.560
He eventually got depressed which led to&nbsp;
his death. She also informs the police&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:31.760
about Ling-Na’s secret camp getting all of&nbsp;
the students arrested. In the end, she is in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:36.640
an interview to promote her new book. She looks&nbsp;
into the camera and says that if you really want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:44.240
something to happen, there is always a way.
